BT /F1 10 Tf 54 336.35999999999996 Td (figures typically three point five to three point nine percent per month. When compounded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 322.85999999999996 Td (annually, this equates to an astronomical Annual Percentage Rate ranging between forty-two) Tj ET
