BT /F1 10 Tf 54 295.85999999999996 Td (Tax on all interest charges and finance fees.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 276.96 Td (To comprehend the mathematical ruin of revolving credit card debt, consider an earner) Tj ET
