BT /F1 10 Tf 54 249.95999999999998 Td (rate of forty-two percent. If the cardholder commits the fatal error of paying only the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 236.45999999999998 Td (minimum five percent amount due each month, it will take over seventeen years to extinguish) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 222.95999999999998 Td (that balance, and the total interest paid to the commercial bank will exceed six lakh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 209.45999999999998 Td (rupees triple the original principal borrowed. Revolving credit card debt is a compounding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 195.95999999999998 Td (emergency that must be treated with the urgency of a five-alarm house fire.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 177.05999999999997 Td (Similarly hazardous are instant digital lending apps and personal micro-loans. Often) Tj ET
