BT /F1 10 Tf 54 550.2 Td (location data to enforce recovery. Any attempt by a lending platform to harvest phone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 536.7 Td (contacts or circulate morphed photographs is a severe criminal offense under the Information) Tj ET
